1. Ownership

SecureGate AI, including its source code, documentation, dashboard design,
configuration files, reports, workflows, examples, and project-specific assets,
is owned by Saima Usman unless otherwise stated.

This repository was created as a final capstone project to demonstrate an
enterprise DevSecOps security decision platform with CI/CD report ingestion,
security scoring, report generation, monitoring, alerts, notifications, and
AI-assisted remediation.

